&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Motive is a dynamic agency and creative collective operating at the speed of culture. We’re a collective of deep thinkers, creative makers, cultural connoisseurs, and executional aces. We create meaningful engagements between brands and their audiences, cultivating relationships that drive tangible results for our clients. And we do it with sharp strategy and powerful creative executed across all the media and touch-points key to our targets’ lives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As pioneers in the area of content, digital engagement, and innovative experiential programs, and award winners for work in TV, event, digital and social, Motive has created a culture where every individual is given an opportunity to stretch and flex their creative and executional muscles daily. We are a team of hard-working, fast-moving, energetic, passionate, driven, straight-talking creative thinkers. We like being challenged and we love the collaboration necessary to overcome the challenges and succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like a place you would thrive, let’s see if we can make something happen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;216&quot; data-end=&quot;240&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;216&quot; data-end=&quot;240&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;218&quot; data-end=&quot;238&quot;&gt;ACCOUNT DIRECTOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;350&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;241&quot; data-end=&quot;254&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Denver&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and experienced Account Director to serve as the senior&amp;nbsp;point of contact for a client in a highly regulated industry (tobacco/nicotine).&amp;nbsp;As an Account Director at Motive, you are the senior steward of your clients’ business and a key&amp;nbsp;driver of agency success. You are responsible for the management, growth, and overall health&amp;nbsp;of client relationships—balancing strategic leadership, team oversight, and operational&amp;nbsp;excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;You serve as the consistent connective force between clients, creative teams, strategy, and&amp;nbsp;production, ensuring that work is insight-led, high-impact, and executed to the highest standard.&amp;nbsp;In this role, you are expected to lead both the what and the how: shaping the direction of your&lt;br&gt;accounts while developing and mentoring the team that makes the work happen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Leadership, Business Growth, &amp;amp; Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior strategic partner for clients, guiding marketing strategy and&amp;nbsp;campaign development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong, trust-based relationships with senior client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and lead organic growth opportunities within accounts, helping to expand&amp;nbsp;Motive’s footprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly assess account health and collaborate with agency leadership to&amp;nbsp;evolve the partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensures all projects, products, marketing, and communications strictly adhere to&amp;nbsp;the specific creative requirements and restrictions of the nicotine industry. This&amp;nbsp;includes navigating regulations around product marketing, age verification, and&amp;nbsp;health warnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Creative Direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate client goals and briefs into actionable strategic and creative&lt;br&gt;workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Strategy to ensure creative briefs are focused, insight-driven, and aligned with broader business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion outstanding creative work, tying ideas back to strategy while advocating for originality, innovation, and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrated Project Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and support execution across a range of deliverables: shopper,&amp;nbsp;experiential, promotions, partnerships and other channels as applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead planning and scoping for projects—developing timelines, budgets, teams,&amp;nbsp;and operational plans in partnership with production and project management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure quality control and accountability throughout all phases of work, from&amp;nbsp;briefing to final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate and manage program changes with internal and external stakeholders,&amp;nbsp;ensuring positive solution-oriented outcomes supporting program, client, and&amp;nbsp;agency success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consistency and clarity for your team; delegating appropriately and&amp;nbsp;creating opportunities for them to step up and tackle new challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor an integrated account team, including AADs, Account&amp;nbsp;Supervisors, and junior staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a collaborative, high-performance culture that values curiosity, integrity,&amp;nbsp;and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide feedback, coaching, and support to ensure continued professional&amp;nbsp;growth of team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Stewardship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns independent brand-level financial leadership, ensuring accuracy,&amp;nbsp;profitability, and fiscal responsibility across accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitors team utilization, billability, and profitability metrics, adjusting as needed&amp;nbsp;to maintain healthy business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads organic growth stewardship by cultivating deeper partnerships with clients and uncovering opportunities beyond current scopes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops projection schedules grounded in business realities and proactively communicates them to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds relationships with senior client stakeholders (beyond project-specific teams) to identify long-term growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Collaboration &amp;amp; Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with internal departments and external agency partners (IAT) to drive fully integrated campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape agency thinking and pitch strategy; participate in new business and innovation efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to internal culture, workflow optimization, and agency-wide learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in This Role Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistency in performance, proactivity in communications (both up and down).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your client relationships are strong, stable, and growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re viewed as a strategic partner—able to elevate the conversation and anticipate&amp;nbsp;needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projects under your leadership are on track, well-scoped, and delivering strong creative&amp;nbsp;outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your team feels supported, challenged, and empowered to do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re helping shape the future of the business—not just managing it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You help teams navigate change with confidence, clarity, and empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Skills for the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years prior experience in account management, often at a marketing or advertising&amp;nbsp;agency, with specific experience in tobacco highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of nicotine industry trends, products, and the evolving regulatory&amp;nbsp;environment to inform business strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading large, multifaceted accounts with traditional, digital, social,&amp;nbsp;content, shopper/retail, and experiential components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to grow client relationships and identify new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership skills, with experience managing and developing cross-functional&amp;nbsp;teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and relationship-building abilities.Political&amp;nbsp;acumen and a strong understanding of state and local regulatory dynamics are also&amp;nbsp;highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong budget, timeline, and resource management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, collaborative, and resilient approach to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive attitude and a drive to produce the best work of your career—and help others&amp;nbsp;do the same.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Motive is an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;equal opportunity employer&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;! We believe that a diverse team makes us stronger and smarter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Motive recruits, employs, trains, compensates and promotes regardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, disability, age, veteran status, and other protected status as required by applicable law. We offer an inspiring working environment and great benefits, including health, dental, vision, matching 401-k, unlimited flex time off, and more. The starting salary for this position is between $120,000 and $145,000 annually, based on experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Motive has a clear vision: to be a creative leader where a diverse mix of talented people want to come, to stay and do their best work. We know our company succeeds only through the hard work and dedication of our passionate and creative employees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-start=&quot;354&quot; data-end=&quot;845&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Motive is a dynamic agency and creative collective operating at the speed of culture. We’re a collective of deep thinkers, creative makers, cultural connoisseurs, and executional aces. We create meaningful engagements between brands and their audiences, cultivating relationships that drive tangible results for our clients. And we do it with sharp strategy and powerful creative executed across all the media and touch-points key to our targets’ lives.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;847&quot; data-end=&quot;1114&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;As pioneers in content, digital engagement, and innovative experiential programs, Motive fosters a culture where individuals stretch their creative and executional muscles daily. If this sounds like a place you would thrive, let’s see if we can make something happen.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;os0jts&quot; data-start=&quot;296&quot; data-end=&quot;352&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;os0jts&quot; data-start=&quot;296&quot; data-end=&quot;352&quot;&gt;ACCOUNT DIRECTOR&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1140&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;We are seeking an Account Director with deep expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1198&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;experiential marketing and sponsorship activation&lt;/strong&gt; to serve as the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1356&quot; data-end=&quot;1401&quot;&gt;day-to-day account lead and driving force&lt;/strong&gt; behind a high-profile hospitality and fan engagement program on behalf of a major sports property. You will guide sponsorship strategy, translate partnership assets into breakthrough experiences, and oversee the &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1614&quot; data-end=&quot;1678&quot;&gt;end-to-end execution of a large-scale experiential ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1681&quot; data-end=&quot;1841&quot;&gt;This is a highly visible role requiring a leader who thrives in complex, fast-moving environments and can deliver &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;world-class experiences on a global stage&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;foqqts&quot; data-start=&quot;1848&quot; data-end=&quot;1879&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;foqqts&quot; data-start=&quot;1848&quot; data-end=&quot;1879&quot;&gt;KEY AREAS OF RESPONSIBILITY&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;1881&quot; data-end=&quot;1924&quot;&gt;Client Leadership &amp;amp; Account Management&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2362&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9rlwrr&quot; data-start=&quot;1925&quot; data-end=&quot;2018&quot;&gt;Lead day-to-day client relationships with confidence, authority, and strategic perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nbwrcv&quot; data-start=&quot;2019&quot; data-end=&quot;2171&quot;&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with senior client stakeholders, as well as key external partners (leagues, governing bodies, rights holders).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ct6dqf&quot; data-start=&quot;2172&quot; data-end=&quot;2289&quot;&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor, translating business objectives into impactful experiential and sponsorship strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8tl2ac&quot; data-start=&quot;2290&quot; data-end=&quot;2362&quot;&gt;Represent Motive in a highly visible role on a marquee global program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;2364&quot; data-end=&quot;2404&quot;&gt;Sponsorship &amp;amp; Experiential Strategy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2405&quot; data-end=&quot;2793&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1v2mceq&quot; data-start=&quot;2405&quot; data-end=&quot;2512&quot;&gt;Translate sponsorship rights, assets, and agreements into compelling, experience-led marketing platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;br35k1&quot; data-start=&quot;2513&quot; data-end=&quot;2630&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to maximize partnership value through innovative fan engagement and hospitality experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pbubqc&quot; data-start=&quot;2631&quot; data-end=&quot;2793&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Strategy and Creative teams to ensure ideas are insight-driven, differentiated, and executable at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;2795&quot; data-end=&quot;2831&quot;&gt;Experiential Program Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2832&quot; data-end=&quot;3257&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ksdual&quot; data-start=&quot;2832&quot; data-end=&quot;2974&quot;&gt;Oversee the end-to-end execution of large-scale experiential activations, including complex builds, environments, and live event ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h08n3n&quot; data-start=&quot;2975&quot; data-end=&quot;3081&quot;&gt;Partner closely with production, fabrication, and operations teams to deliver best-in-class experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9von5y&quot; data-start=&quot;3082&quot; data-end=&quot;3164&quot;&gt;Manage integrated work streams across experiential, content, digital, and social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gkmy01&quot; data-start=&quot;3165&quot; data-end=&quot;3257&quot;&gt;Ensure all programs are delivered on time, on budget, and at the highest level of quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;3259&quot; data-end=&quot;3293&quot;&gt;Onsite Leadership &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3294&quot; data-end=&quot;3575&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w8a7f6&quot; data-start=&quot;3294&quot; data-end=&quot;3391&quot;&gt;Serve as a senior leader onsite during key program moments, including events and installations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pn186i&quot; data-start=&quot;3392&quot; data-end=&quot;3505&quot;&gt;Manage clients and stakeholders in real time, troubleshoot issues, and ensure flawless delivery under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jrtgmf&quot; data-start=&quot;3506&quot; data-end=&quot;3575&quot;&gt;Lead cross-functional teams through high-stakes, live environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-start=&quot;3577&quot; data-end=&quot;3615&quot;&gt;Business Growth &amp;amp; Team Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3616&quot; data-end=&quot;3872&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5bne51&quot; data-start=&quot;3616&quot; data-end=&quot;3719&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities to grow the business within the account and broader sports/experiential space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d7l9i3&quot; data-start=&quot;3720&quot; data-end=&quot;3782&quot;&gt;Lead, mentor, and inspire internal teams across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1vhq5cs&quot; data-start=&quot;3783&quot; data-end=&quot;3872&quot;&gt;Foster collaboration across internal and external partners to drive best-in-class work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1x0s9bz&quot; data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3905&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1x0s9bz&quot; data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3905&quot;&gt;CANDIDATE REQUIREMENTS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3907&quot; data-end=&quot;4849&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yvv1q0&quot; data-start=&quot;3907&quot; data-end=&quot;4018&quot;&gt;10+ years of integrated agency experience, with a strong focus on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3975&quot; data-end=&quot;4017&quot;&gt;experiential marketing and live events&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yvirc8&quot; data-start=&quot;4019&quot; data-end=&quot;4133&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4047&quot; data-end=&quot;4084&quot;&gt;large-scale experiential programs&lt;/strong&gt;, including complex builds and live environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mdchnn&quot; data-start=&quot;4134&quot; data-end=&quot;4262&quot;&gt;Deep expertise in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4154&quot; data-end=&quot;4204&quot;&gt;sports partnerships and sponsorship ecosystems&lt;/strong&gt;, including rights holders, leagues, and governing bodies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nam4vk&quot; data-start=&quot;4263&quot; data-end=&quot;4367&quot;&gt;Experience working on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4287&quot; data-end=&quot;4313&quot;&gt;global sporting events such as Olympics or Paralymics&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10x3dfp&quot; data-start=&quot;4368&quot; data-end=&quot;4437&quot;&gt;Strong background in &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4391&quot; data-end=&quot;4436&quot;&gt;hospitality and VIP experience management&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jxprhb&quot; data-start=&quot;4438&quot; data-end=&quot;4532&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage complex programs with multiple stakeholders and moving parts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xk245v&quot; data-start=&quot;4533&quot; data-end=&quot;4612&quot;&gt;Experience scoping and managing large budgets; procurement experience a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;111l9x8&quot; data-start=&quot;4613&quot; data-end=&quot;4685&quot;&gt;Strong leadership skills with experience managing and mentoring teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1exwv6i&quot; data-start=&quot;4686&quot; data-end=&quot;4785&quot;&gt;A proactive, solutions-oriented mindset with the ability to thrive in high-pressure environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1e24bgf&quot; data-start=&quot;4786&quot; data-end=&quot;4849&quot;&gt;Passion for culturally relevant, experience-driven marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;dyg10z&quot; data-start=&quot;4856&quot; data-end=&quot;4883&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;dyg10z&quot; data-start=&quot;4856&quot; data-end=&quot;4883&quot;&gt;ADDITIONAL REQUIREMENTS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4885&quot; data-end=&quot;5060&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nibhk7&quot; data-start=&quot;4885&quot; data-end=&quot;4961&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel and be onsite for key program milestones and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cug3zj&quot; data-start=&quot;4962&quot; data-end=&quot;5060&quot;&gt;Flexibility to work non-standard hours as required by live event schedules and global timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;i9zo7k&quot; data-start=&quot;5067&quot; data-end=&quot;5094&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;i9zo7k&quot; data-start=&quot;5067&quot; data-end=&quot;5094&quot;&gt;COMPENSATION &amp;amp; BENEFITS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5096&quot; data-end=&quot;5339&quot;&gt;Motive is an equal opportunity employer committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We offer an inspiring working environment and competitive benefits, including health, dental, vision, matching 401k, unlimited flex time off, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5341&quot; data-end=&quot;5442&quot;&gt;The starting salary for this position is between $115,000 and $145,000 annually, based on experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Motive is a dynamic agency and creative collective operating at the speed of culture. We’re a collective of deep thinkers, creative makers, cultural connoisseurs, and executional aces. We create meaningful engagements between brands and their audiences, cultivating relationships that drive tangible results for our clients. And we do it with sharp strategy and powerful creative executed across all the media and touch-points key to our targets’ lives.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;As pioneers in the area of content, digital engagement, and innovative experiential programs, and award winners for work in TV, event, digital and social, Motive has created a culture where every individual is given an opportunity to stretch and flex their creative and executional muscles daily. We are a team of hard-working, fast-moving, energetic, passionate, driven, straight-talking creative thinkers. We like being challenged and we love the collaboration necessary to overcome the challenges and succeed.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If this sounds like a place you would thrive, let’s see if we can make something happen.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOUNT EXECUTIVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; at Motive, you play a key role in the day-to-day execution of client work. You are the connective tissue between the client and our internal teams—responsible for driving projects forward, supporting strategic thinking, and ensuring work is delivered on time, on brief, and within budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a foundational role on the account team, offering exposure to a broad range of work including traditional, experiential, digital, promotional and media. You’ll collaborate with creative, strategy, brand experience and production, as well as other departments while continuing to grow your skills as a marketer, project manager, and client partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the account team in managing daily client communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships based on trust, responsiveness, and professionalism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help translate client needs into agency action—balancing what’s best for the client and what’s best for the work.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
