&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MARKETING AND COMMUNICATIONS SUPERVISOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Marketing and Communications Supervisor supports the execution of the network’s marketing and communications strategy in close partnership with internal key stakeholders and senior leadership. This role manages day-to-day marketing, communications, PR, and partnership initiatives, ensuring alignment with overarching global priorities and brand direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Supervisor serves as a key collaborator across teams and agencies, helping translate strategic vision into actionable plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the VP of Global Marketing to develop and execute strategic marketing, communications and PR initiatives to drive awareness and impact for a global marketing and advertising network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day planning and implementation of campaigns, ensuring timelines, budgets, and deliverables are met.&lt;/li&gt;
