&lt;li&gt;Maintain and evolve the network’s digital presence (web and social), driving engagement among internal and external audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic awareness efforts that contribute to new business development and brand visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in brainstorming and planning sessions, contributing insights and recommendations to strengthen marketing initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
